# Sunbird RC — vocabularies for the reference implementations
#
# https://w3id.org/sunbird-rc/agriculture/v1
#   The JSON-LD context document for the Agriculture credentials issued by the Sunbird RC
#   reference implementations. The vocabulary namespace is the same identifier with a
#   fragment: https://w3id.org/sunbird-rc/agriculture/v1#
#
# The v1 identifier and its term semantics are permanent. A change in meaning will be a new
# path (v2), never an edit to this one, because the term IRIs are covered by the signatures
# on credentials already issued.
#
# The target is pinned to an immutable commit and is served as application/ld+json with CORS
# enabled. 302 rather than 301 is deliberate: the identifier is permanent but the hosting
# location is expected to move to the official Sunbird RC organisation, and a cached 301
# would outlive that move.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Kartheek Palla
# GitHub username: pallakartheekreddy
# Project: https://github.com/Sunbird-RC/sunbird-rc-reference-implementations

RewriteEngine on

RewriteRule ^agriculture/v1/?$ https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/pallakartheekreddy/sunbird-rc-reference-implementations@2eec9cb87845f19e27cf33c4decbf9d39f876c38/contexts/agriculture/v1/context.jsonld [R=302,L]
